      "a": "The federal government obligated $400M through SDVOSB set-asides in FY2027 to date. The program recorded 1,481 awards with an average award size of $270K, and obligations fell 96.0% year over year. Prior fiscal years show larger totals, for example $10.1B in FY26 and $9.1B in FY23."
    },
    {
